      "refersTo": "daily-bar",
      "description": "可选择日柱，段顺序为从上到下蓝、灰、绿；数值为预览示例。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-day\" aria-label=\"周一，示例用量\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-day-rail\"><span class=\"ds-day-bar\"><i class=\"ds-output\"></i><i class=\"ds-input\"></i><i class=\"ds-cache\"></i></span></span><span>一</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-day{font-family:var(--default-font-family,\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei UI\",sans-serif);color:var(--cq-ink,#21201c);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;width:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;background:transparent;font-size:9px;line-height:18px;cursor:pointer;} .ds-day-rail{width:100%;height:46px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cq-s6,#dad9d6);} .ds-day-bar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;height:40px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cq-ink,#21201c) 58%,transparent);outline-offset:1px;} .ds-day-bar i{display:block;} .ds-output{height:10%;background:var(--cq-chart-output,#0d74ce);} .ds-input{height:20%;background:var(--cq-chart-input,#d8dce0);} .ds-cache{height:70%;background:var(--cq-chart-cache,#30a46c);} .ds-day:hover .ds-day-bar{opacity:.7;} .ds-day:active{background:var(--cq-s5,#e2e1de);} .ds-day:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cq-ink,#21201c);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Composition disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "默认折叠的内容行，以细分隔建立层级。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-fold\"><summary>消耗构成 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></summary><div class=\"ds-fold-body\">非缓存输入 ／ 缓存输入 ／ 输出</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-fold{font-family:var(--default-font-family,\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei UI\",sans-serif);color:var(--cq-ink,#21201c);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;width:260px;border-top:1px solid var(--cq-s6,#dad9d6);background:var(--cq-solid,#f9f9f8);} .ds-fold summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;list-style:none;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:17.25px;cursor:pointer;} .ds-fold summary span{margin-left:auto;transition:transform 220ms;} .ds-fold[open] summary span{transform:rotate(90deg);} .ds-fold summary:hover{background:var(--cq-s4,#e9e8e6);} .ds-fold summary:active{background:var(--cq-s5,#e2e1de);} .ds-fold summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cq-ink,#21201c);outline-offset:2px;} .ds-fold-body{padding:1px 12px 9px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:15px;} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-fold summary span{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "本机用量 · 双刻度",
    "overview": "以用户实机反馈后的双刻度方案为视觉依据：两个主要指标上下分行，标签在左、数值在右且共用右边界，取消静态语义记号。紧凑的 Sand 浅深表面承接侧栏中的短时观察，详细口径按需披露。\n\n本文记录 2026-11-04 候选渲染层已经采用的令牌与组件。令牌以前置表为准；主题选择沿用宿主，面板颜色由局部 Sand 令牌控制，不把旧版半透明宿主材质继续作为本轮要求。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "上下分行的双主读数，每行标签左对齐、数值右对齐。",
      "同心圆角、对称内边距与低噪声分隔。",
      "数据色语义稳定，缺失与错误明确可见。",
      "开合可打断，文字不缩放，完成后清理临时样式。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Stable Data Color",
        "body": "灰只表达非缓存输入，绿只表达缓存输入，蓝只表达输出；数据色用于图形，读数文字使用中性 ink。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Concentric Corners",
        "body": "同心圆角按外层圆角减去内缩量递减，保持面板、轨道、控件与数据格之间的几何关系。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "Material With Content",
        "body": "材质与内容共同进入和退出；中断或反向从当前可见状态继续，结束清理临时样式与动画。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保持主读数上下堆叠；长范围按上下界分组换行。",
      "Do 使用 Sand 11／12 作为正文层级，保留标签和文字图例。",
      "Do 在草稿提交前保留原结果及其真实时间。",
      "Do 将来源、参考档位、价格与诊断集中在设置中。",
      "Do 遵守减少动态效果、键盘焦点与强制颜色模式。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把本机估算、账号百分点变化或 API 等值改称真实本机扣量或实付费用。",
      "Don't 用数据色给读数文字着色，或把无记录与采样不足填成零。",
      "Don't 让浅灰段无边界地贴住面板底色；无缓存底座时保留描边。",
      "Don't 把未来日期生成为可聚焦或可点击的按钮。",
      "Don't 恢复四个内容页签、旧 footer 额度卡、独立窗口或居中大 Modal。"
    ]
  }
}
